# project: dynamic-batch
# summary: Snapshot an external workload, drain it without repeated lookups, then refresh once.
VAR remaining: number = ?

=== work ===
Process one unit from the captured batch.
~ remaining -= 1
while {remaining > 0} [More in this batch] -> work
else [Batch flushed] -> refresh

=== refresh ===
Refresh the external workload only after the captured batch is exhausted.
? remaining
while {remaining > 0} [New batch available] -> work
else [Workload clear] -> END
